Suggested Enhancements

Atomic invite acceptance via Supabase RPC — Use a Postgres function that does the used_at check and team_members insert in a single transaction with row-level locking.
Join code with role parameter — Support /join/T253QL?role=player so coaches can generate role-specific join codes too, not just a generic "parent" code.
Expected member → real member matching — When a new user joins, show a modal: "Are you or your child one of these expected members?" with a list of PENDING names.
Expiry enforced at DB level — Add .lt("expires_at", "now()") to the Supabase query or use a Postgres RPC that enforces it atomically.
Invite link QR code enhancement — Add team logo and team name overlaid on the QR code for professional appearance.
staleTime on join-code query — Reduce to 30s or add manual invalidation when the coach resets the code.

